                                "sense_id": "d2abdbca-a92c-3fed-af93-e5c4d1027c69",
                                "text": "There is a misprint in the first print run: On page 42 where the character yells, \"You're going to catch a cod if you spend all night fishing\", the dialogue was meant to say, \"You're going to catch a cold if you spend all night fishing.\""
